    "text": "<p>Which of the following sets are correct regarding polymer:</p><p>(A) Copolymer : Buna-<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi></math></p><p>(B) Condensation polymer : Nylon-<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>6</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>6</mn></math></p><p>(C) Fibres : Nylon-<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>6</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>6</mn></math></p><p>(D) Thermosetting polymer : Terylene</p><p>(E) Homopolymers : Buna-<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></math></p><p>Choose the correct answer from given options below</p>"
