  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Which of the following set are correct regarding polymer.</p><p>Buna <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi></math>&nbsp;is copolymer of butadiene <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>+</mo></math>&nbsp;styrene</p><p>Nylon <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>6</mn></math>&nbsp;is condensation polymer of adipic Acid and hexanediamine.</p><p>Nylon <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>6</mn></math>&nbsp;is fibre.</p><p>Terylene is fibre&nbsp;not thermosetting polymer</p><p>Buna-<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></math> is copolymer not&nbsp;Homopolymer</p>"
